OL,3,GNEWSA'We live and work next to a huge
OL,4,Aillegal waste dump'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's like it happened overnight or
OL,7,Fsomething. It's just like one day, it
OL,8,Fjust sort of spawned."
OL,10,FBilal, a mechanic, is talking about the
OL,11,Fseveral thousand tonnes of mixed
OL,12,Fhousehold and commercial waste that has
OL,13,Fbeen dumped at an illegal site off
OL,14,FMidland Road in Bradford, close to his
OL,15,Fworkplace.
OL,17,FThe unauthorised dump was even visited
OL,18,Fby prime minister Andy Burnham, who
OL,19,Fchose the location to announce plans to
OL,20,Ftoughen up regulations around
OL,21,Ffly-tipping and waste crime.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
