OL,3,GNEWSA'We live and work next to a huge
OL,4,Aillegal waste dump'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBilal is well-placed to observe the
OL,7,Fdevelopment of the site from Trax
OL,8,FTyres, on the opposite side of the
OL,9,Froad. The narrow strip of land is
OL,10,Fhardly remote - it is close to the
OL,11,Frailway line and Bradford City's Valley
OL,12,FParade football stadium - yet the
OL,13,Fdumping of rubbish has been brazenly
OL,14,Fcarried out.
